<ul dir="auto">
<li>Creates a new directory for "classic" docs under <code class="notranslate">webdriver/reference</code>.</li>
<li>Moves existing reference docs to <code class="notranslate">webdriver/reference/classic</code>.</li>
<li>Updates the WebDriver sidebar to reflect these changes.</li>
<li>Cleans up the landing pages.</li>
<li>Ensures all page titles reflect the "classic" context.</li>
</ul>
<h3 dir="auto">Motivation</h3>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>To classify the current docs as classic</li>
<li>To reorganize existing directory structure before we add more classic reference pages for commands etc</li>
<li>To prepare for the addition of BiDi content</li>
</ul>
<h3 dir="auto">Additional details</h3>
<p dir="auto">BCD already organizes the compat data by:</p>
