</ul>
<h3 dir="auto">Related links</h3>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Classic spec: <a href="https://w3c.github.io/webdriver/" rel="nofollow">https://w3c.github.io/webdriver/</a></li>
<li>BiDi spec: <a href="https://w3c.github.io/webdriver-bidi/" rel="nofollow">https://w3c.github.io/webdriver-bidi/</a></li>
