        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">FF148 adds support for <code class="notranslate">addHandler()</code> method of <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/NavigationPrecommitController" rel="nofollow">NavigationPrecommitController</a> in <a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2009004" rel="nofollow">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2009004</a>.</p>
<p dir="auto">This allows you to add a post commit handler in your precommit handler, rather than statically passing it in the object when <code class="notranslate">intercept()</code> is called. You'll use this if the precommit affects the post commit.</p>
<p dir="auto">This adds docs for the method.</p>
